870
00:28:15,149 --> 00:28:17,842
Over decades, that one decision freed up

871
00:28:17,842 --> 00:28:18,516
a fortune.

872
00:28:18,696 --> 00:28:20,933
And that fortune bought them something no

873
00:28:20,933 --> 00:28:21,588
car can buy,

874
00:28:21,588 --> 00:28:22,516
